{"id":"NCT07595653","title":"A Study to Evaluate the Impact of Efgartigimod on Overall Disease Experience of People Suffering From Generalized Myasthenia Gravis (gMG) in Italy","official":"Non-interventional, Longitudinal Hybrid Data Sources Study to Evaluate the Impact of Efgartigimod on Overall Disease Experience of People Suffering From Generalized Myasthenia Gravis (gMG) in Italy","summary":"This study aims to generate real world evidence (RWE) from Italian clinical practice on the impact of efgartigimod alfa in gMG patients encompassing clinical outcomes and patient reported experiences.\n\nThe study population will consist in adult patients with a documented diagnosis of gMG who are AChR-antibody positive and for whom the decision of treatment with efgartigimod alfa for gMG has been made independently of study participation as part of routine clinical care.\n\nThe total study duration will be up to 23 months","conditions":["Generalized Myasthenia Gravis (gMG)","gMG"],"interventions":[],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* At least 18 years old at signing of informed Consent Form (ICF) and privacy form (PF)\n* Documented diagnosis of gMG\n* AChR-antibody positive\n* The treating physician has decided to initiate efgartigimod alfa as part of routine clinical care and in accordance with product labelling, independently from the study\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Hypersensitivity to the active substance or to any of the excipients listed: sodium dihydrogen phosphate, monohydrate; disodium hydrogen phosphate, anhydrous; arginine hydrochloride; polysorbate 80, hyaluronidase, histidine, histidine hydrochloride monohydrate, methionine, polysorbate 20, sucrose.\n* Current or planned participation in an interventional clinical trial.","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":100,"start":"2026-02-25","pcd":"2027-11","upd":"2026-05-19","sponsor":"argenx","areas":["neurology","rare"],"central":["Sabine Coppieters, MD · 857-350-4834 · clinicaltrials@argenx.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Ospedale Generale Regionale F. Miulli","city":"Acquaviva delle Fonti","pr":"","zip":"70021","s":"R","lat":40.897,"lon":16.8433,"c":"Antonella Petruzzellis, MD · 857-350-4834 · clinicaltrials@argenx.com"},{"f":"Azienda Ospedaliero Universitaria delle Marche","city":"Ancona","pr":"","zip":"60126","s":"R","lat":43.6072,"lon":13.5103,"c":"Francesca Lupidi, MD · 857-350-4834 · clinicaltrials@argenx.com"},{"f":"A.O.U. Consorziale Policlinico","city":"Bari","pr":"","zip":"70124","s":"R","lat":41.1207,"lon":16.8698,"c":"Giammarco Milella, MD · 857-350-4834 · clinicaltrials@argenx.com"},{"f":"ASST Papa Giovanni XXIII","city":"Bergamo","pr":"","zip":"24127","s":"R","lat":45.696,"lon":9.6672,"c":"Manlio Sgarzi, MD · 857-350-4834 · clinicaltrials@argenx.com"},{"f":"Ospedale Bellaria","city":"Bologna","pr":"","zip":"40139","s":"R","lat":44.4938,"lon":11.3387,"c":"Maria Pia Giannoccaro, MD · 857-350-4834 · clinicaltrials@argenx.com"},{"f":"A.O.U. Renato Dulbecco","city":"Catanzaro","pr":"","zip":"88100","s":"R","lat":38.8825,"lon":16.6009,"c":"Michele Trimboli, MD · 857-350-4834 · clinicaltrials@argenx.com"},{"f":"A.O.U. Careggi","city":"Florence","pr":"","zip":"50134","s":"R","lat":43.7792,"lon":11.2463,"c":"Valentina Damato, MD · 857-350-4834 · clinicaltrials@argenx.com"},{"f":"IRCCS Ospedale Policlinico San Martino","city":"Genova","pr":"","zip":"16132","s":"R","lat":45.216,"lon":11.8721,"c":"Marina Grandis, MD · 857-350-4834 · clinicaltrials@argenx.com"},{"f":"A.O.U. Policlinico G. Martino","city":"Messina","pr":"","zip":"98124","s":"R","lat":38.1939,"lon":15.5526,"c":"Carmelo Rodolico, MD · 857-350-4834 · clinicaltrials@argenx.com"},{"f":"IRCCS Cà Granda Ospedale Maggiore Policlinico","city":"Milan","pr":"","zip":"20122","s":"R","lat":42.7824,"lon":12.5984,"c":"Daniele Velardo, MD · 857-350-4834 · clinicaltrials@argenx.com"},{"f":"Ospedale San Raffaele","city":"Milan","pr":"","zip":"20132","s":"R","l